    <string name="vpn_disclosure_title">Allow device-wide VPN traffic?</string>
    <string name="vpn_disclosure_body">RatelMesh creates an encrypted VPN for this device. While connected, network traffic from other apps can pass through your selected mesh or exit node. To operate the connection, RatelMesh sends your device name, public key and reachable network endpoints to your coordinator, and processes peer handshake times and byte counters on this device. It does not collect or share traffic content, and it never redirects traffic for advertising. A selected exit node can see destination IP addresses and traffic timing, like any VPN gateway; HTTPS content remains encrypted.</string>
